#: ../../chapter11.rst:3
msgid "Upgrade CentreStack"
msgstr "升级CentreStack"

#: ../../chapter11.rst:5
msgid ""
"We publish updated notes to our public blog forum called `CentreStack "
"Blog`_. It is recommended that you perform an update if your self-hosted "
"CentreStack and clients are three months or older."
msgstr "我们会在名为 `CentreStack Blog`_ 的公共博客论坛上发布更新说明。如果您自托管的CentreStack及其客户端的版本超过三个月，我们建议您进行更新。"

#: ../../chapter11.rst:8
msgid "Using the GUI Installer to Upgrade"
msgstr "使用图形用户界面安装程序进行升级"

#: ../../chapter11.rst:10
msgid ""
"To install an update go to your `Partner Portal`_ (Self-Hosted "
"CentreStack -> Download) and download the GUI installer."
msgstr "要安装更新，请转到您的 `Partner Portal`_ （自托管中心堆栈->下载）并下载GUI安装程序。"

#: ../../chapter11.rst:14
msgid ""
"When you run the GUI installer, it will detect the existing installation "
"and perform an upgrade."
msgstr "当您运行图形用户界面安装程序时，它会检测到现有安装并执行升级。"

